The geometry in this directory (heart.glb, heart.manifest.json, heart-still.png) is derived from:

  Rodero C, Strocchi M, Marciniak M, Longobardi S, Whitaker J, O'Neill MD, Gillette K,
  Augustin C, Plank G, Vigmond EJ, Lamata P, Niederer SA.
  Virtual cohort of extreme and average four-chamber heart meshes from statistical shape model.
  Zenodo, 2021. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4593739

which is published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The derived files are distributed under the same
licence. Changes made: the outer surface was extracted from the volume mesh, decimated, and written
as glTF; AHA segment labels were derived from the coordinates the source carries. The manifest
records exactly how. The mesh is a population mean and represents no individual.

This licence applies to the data files in this directory only. The software in this repository is
licensed separately under Apache-2.0; see the LICENSE file at the repository root.
